          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulokhu, uJehova uyakuthethelela inceku yakho ukuthi uma inkosi yami ingena endlini kaRimoni ukukhonza khona, yeyame esandleni sami, mina ngikhothame endlini kaRimoni; uma ngikhothama endlini kaRimoni, uJehova athethelele inceku yakho kule ndaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuye: “Hamba ngokuthula.” Ngakho wasuka kancane kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uGehazi, inceku ka-Elisha, umuntu kaNkulunkulu, wathi: “Bheka, inkosi yami yamyeka uNahamani lo umAramu ngokungamukeli esandleni sakhe lokho akulethile; kodwa kuphila kukaJehova, ngizagijima ngimlandele, ngithathe okuthile kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGehazi wasemlandela uNahamani. UNahamani embona egijima emva kwakhe, wehla enqoleni ukumhlangabeza, wathi: “Uyaphila na?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Kulungile.” Inkosi yami ingithumile ukuthi: ‘Bheka, manje kufike kimi izinsizwa ezimbili ezivela kumadodana abaprofethi zivela ezintabeni zakwa-Efrayimi; ubanike italenta lesiliva nezingubo zangaphansi ezimbili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayesethi uNahamani: “Suka, uthathe amathalenta amabili.” Wamncenga, wabophela amatalenta amabili esiliva emasakeni amabili, nezingubo zangaphansi ezimbili, wakubeka phezu kwezinceku zakhe ezimbili; bathwala phambi kwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esefikile embhoshongweni, wakuthatha esandleni sabo, wakubeka endlini; wawadedela amadoda, ahamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yena wangena wema phambi kwenkosi yakhe. U-Elisha wathi kuye: “Uvelaphi, Gehazi? Wathi: “Inceku yakho ayihambanga ndawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kuye: “Inhliziyo yami ayihambanga yini nawe lapho lowo muntu ephenduka enqoleni yakhe ukukuhlangabeza na?” Yisikhathi sokwamukela imali yini, sokwamukela izingubo zokugqoka, neminqumo, nezivini, nezimvu, nezinkomo, nezinceku, nezincekukazi, na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
